    <b>Executive Summary:</b><br/>
    Launching <b>NEXUS AI Agent</b> using the main engine <b>deepseek-v4-flash</b> is extremely cost-effective. 
    A 10 Million Token package costs only <b>¥5.12 RMB (~$0.78 USD)</b>. Each user request costs less than <b>$0.0008 USD (0.0057 RMB)</b>. 
    If monetized with a Pro subscription at $9.99/month, the platform yields a gross profit margin of over <b>95%</b>.
  </div>

