  <h2>3. Token Depletion Audit: Why Balance Dropped to 29.7% (Root Cause Analysis)</h2>
  <div class="highlight-box" style="background-color: #fff7ed; border-left-color: #f97316;">
    <b>⚠️ Important Audit Finding for Management:</b><br/>
    The 70.3% token drop since Monday was NOT caused by <i>deepseek-v4-flash</i>. 
    It was consumed by testing heavy <b>Claude Sonnet & Fable models</b> which have a <b>12x to 30x higher multiplier</b>!
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Model Tested</th>
        <th>Requests Made in CSV</th>
        <th>Total Tokens / Quota Consumed</th>
        <th>% of Total 10M Token Package Spent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
